{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/861019-homebrew-w20-setting-nights-of-silver-and-blood-feedback-wanted","id":861019,"title":"Homebrew W20 setting Nights of Silver and Blood- Feedback wanted!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-07T07:13:33-07:00","id":861019,"title":"Homebrew W20 setting Nights of Silver and Blood- Feedback wanted!","content":"Hi all.<br /> I have been working on a setting for W20 and I wanted to have some feedback if at all possible. This is just the start and I am still working on it but I hope to have the project finished by the end of the year. Please enjoy and let me know what you think so far. Thanks!<br /> <b><u>Werewolf the Apocalypse: </u></b><br /> Nights of Silver and Blood<br /> What in Gaia\u2019s name is this?<br /> -Simply this is an attempt to tell tales from the first change all the way to the foretold apocalypse. This is a way to take WtF to a more modern adaptation. Using W20 as my guide I will pen plot hooks and story ideas that will aid storytellers and enrich the world of darkness.<br /> What this is not!<br /> -This is not an attempt to improve and already amazing product. I am a longtime fan of White Wolf Publishing and The Onyx Path and I want this body of work to represent that love. Seriously, I love you guys!<br /> <b><u>World building in the 21<sup>st</sup> Century.</u></b><br /> The Garou and the fera faced their end in the final (!?!?) Game supplement published in 2004, aptly titled Apocalypse. This book as filled to the brim with story hooks and ways to tailor the end to the storytellers and their players. The book was a wet dream. <br /> But just like that\u2026.the story was over. The rich tapestry that was built, lay shelved in thousands of nerds bookshelves. The songs of the Garou\u2019s victory\u2019s and sacrifices went unheard for years.<br /> Enter Wtf 20<sup>. </sup>This updated version brought the werewolves to the modern nights and effectively stalled the doomsday clock that hung like a noose. I was overjoyed to see the quality of this book and then it dawned on me. How do you stall the clock? How can you modernize the World of Darkness but still maintain the over looming threat of the Apocalypse? How can you give Gaia\u2019s forces a fighting chance? Where can you find hope?<br /> Thru these pages I will seek to give my perspective to these questions. I wanted to do this for many reason but honestly, I wanted to do it for me. Here we go!<br /> <b><u>One second to midnight.</u></b><br /> The apocalypse is nigh and gaia (with help of high ranking spirits and an alliance of fera and mages) manages to halt the apocalypse. This seals away the final battleground with many key players on both sides inside, limits the access to many umbral realms, halts anthelios the red star in the sky, and manages to commune with all of her servants for a brief moment. She leaves a message to each breed and tribe, briefly telling them their duties in the final nights. Then she vanishes. The world was saved for a time at least.<br /> *What this does*<br /> This is an effort to honor the stories of the older werewolf books but allows the growth and evolution of the Garou Nation to match the modern times. This allows older material to still stand, while still allowing the modernization of this work. It also breaks thru a lot of the stereotypes and bias held by and tribes and breeds and lets them know what\u2019s really going on and a better direction of where to go and what to do. <br /> <b><u>Gaia\u2019s last words</u></b><br /> The great mother has left each member of the Fera with words of guidance and caution. Along with this a vision will appear to all breeds soon after their first change. This vision can be created by the player or storyteller. (See possible table).<br /> The impact of Gaia\u2019s word has shaken the tribes to their core. Their failings made known to them and the ability to rectify their mistakes and made many change their spots so to speak. For some the weight of their failings has caused them to fall into despair and seek an honorable death. For some it has only vindicated their paths. It is a time of refocusing and reshuffling of alliances and roles. What was broken and old can be make strong and new.<br /> <b><u>BLACK FURIES: </u></b><i>WEAKNESS IS FOUND IN THE SOUL MORE OFTEN THAN THE BODY/ FEW DOUBT YOUR STRENGTH MORE THAN YOU DOUBT IT YOURSELF/ FORSAKE NONE WHO WOULD HONOR THE SACRIFICES ALREADY MADE WITH YOUR BLOODS BLOOD.</i><br /> <b><u>BONE GNAWERS: </u></b><i>THE MOTHER HAS NO LOWBORN CHILDREN/ SURIVAL IS WORTHLESS IF IT MEANS YOU ONLY LIVE ONE BREATH LONGER THAN YOUR SIBLINGS/ YOUR KNOWLEDGE IS MORE VALUABLE THAN YOU KNOW, DO NOT LET IT GO WASTED.</i><br /> <b><u>CHILDREN OF GAIA: </u></b><i>AN AIDLED MIND IS A WASTED WEAPON WITH NO VALUE/ YOUR HANDS ARE MINE OWN USE THEM TO FIND AND HEAL THE LOST WHERE EVER THEY MAY BE/ FIND PERFECTION IN THE IMPERFECT, SHOW THEM THE WAY.</i><br /> <b><u>FIANNA: </u></b><i>BE NOT AFRAID OF THE PAST, BUT BE SURE TO CORRECT YOUR MISTAKES/TO HIDE YOUR SINS IN BLOOD WITH ONLY DEEPENDS YOUR ATTOINMENT / USE THE GREEN TO ITS FULLEST AND WASTE NOT A DROP</i><br /> <b><u>GET OF FENRIS: </u></b><i>ATTONMENT TAKES MANY FORMS, FIND ONE THAT BEST SERVES ALL/ THERE IS NO HONOR IN BLIND PRIDE/ USE YOUR RAGE TO MAKE THE OTHERS STRONG, LEST YOU STAND ALONE IN THE DARK.</i><br /> <b><u>GLASS WALKERS:</u></b> <i>ONE CANNOT SERVE TWO MASTERS AND REAMAIN LOYAL TO BOTH/ LEARN WHAT WEBS TO SHAKE AND WITCH ONES TO BREAK LEST WE ALL DROWN IN STAGNIATION/ USE WHAT YOU KNOW AND LEAD THE HERD LEST THE FALL TO CREUL CLAWS OF THE THREE SISTERS.</i><br /> <b><u>RED TALONS: </u></b><i>A REDENED MAW FILLED WITH INNOCENT BLOOD ONLY FEEDS THE WRYM FATTER/YOUR TEETH ARE SHARP BUT LACK DIRECTION/ LOOK TO YOUR COUSINS AND SHOW THEM THE MEANING OF WEARING THE WOLF.</i><br /> <b><u>SHADOW LORDS</u></b><i>: TO RULE A GRAVEYARD IS TO RULE OVER A MEANINGLESS THRONE/BE A LIGHT IN THE DARKNESS/TIME IS SHORT, USE IT WISELY.</i><br /> <b><u>SILENT STRIDERS:</u></b> <i>HEAL YOUR HOMELAND, WHEREVER IT MAY BE/ THE BLOOD OF THE ENDTIMES FALL IN EACH OF YOUR FOOTPRINTS/THE OLD ONES KNOW MORE THAN SAND AND PAST GLORIES, BE THEIR SCRIBE AND USE THEIR WISDOM BEFORE IT\u2019S GONE.</i><br /> <b><u>SILVER FANGS</u></b>: <i>A POISOINED TREE WILL ONLY GROW POISOINED FRUIT UNLESS HEALED OF ITS AILMENTS/ THE WEIGHT OF A CROWN MUST MATCH THE STEEL OF ITS BEARER/ THE SILVER WILL GUIDE YOU, FIND ITS LIGHT AND SHARE IT.</i><br /> <b><u>STARGAZERS: </u></b><i>MIND THE PRESENT AS TO ENSURE YOUR FUTURE AND REDEAM YOUR PAST/ WATCH THE RED EYE AND KNOW WHAT IT DREAMS/THE FINAL BATTLE MAY NOT BE THE FINAL BATTLE, LEARN THE DIFFERENCE AND PREPAIR.</i><br /> <b><u>UKTENA:</u></b><i> SECRECTS ARE YOUR CURRENCY BUT THEY WILL NOT SAVE US UNLESS YOU APPLY WHAT YOU KNOW/ MIDDLE BROTHER FORGIVES YOUAND CRIES FOR DELIVERENCE/FIND THE LOST PLACES AND HARNESS THEIR POWER.</i><br /> <b><u>WENDIGO: </u></b><i>ICE BURNS ALL WHO WEILD IT EVENTUALLY/MIDDLE BROTHER BLAMES YOU NOT FOR HIS FALL, HE WILL TELL YOU SO WHEN YOU FIND HIM/THE TIME FOR TEARS HAS COME AND PAST, INACTION WILL DAMN ALL, GUILTY OR NO.</i><br /> <b><u>------</u></b><br /> <b><u>BUNYIP: </u></b>YOUR ABSENCE IS FELT NOW MORE THAN EVER/LOOK TO THE WALKERS<br /> <b><u>CROATAN: </u></b>THE MIDDLE IS NEEDED FOR THE EATER IS NOT YET DEAD/<br /> <b><u>WHITE HOWLERS:</u></b> THE SPIRAL WORKS BOTH WAYS, LOOK UP AND FIND YOUR WAY BACK TO THE LIGHT.<br /> <b><u>========</u></b><br /> <b><u>FERA</u></b><br /> <br /> <b><u>LUNA\u2019S JUDGMENT </u></b><br /> After the pronucmnet for Gaia was heard all over the world, the Garou were not allowed a chance to breath as Luna the sister of Gaia made here presence known. Enraged at the failures of the Garou and the lengths that her sister had to go to to reign in her children she cursed the werewolves who sin the most and shirked their duty. In one moment fully 1/4<sup>th</sup> of the nation screamed in pain as a silver make of shame was burned into their skin, marking them all. This mark of shame was the glyph of the realm of Erebus the realms of penance for all Garou. Luna demanded that any with this mark must go and repent of their wrongdoings and until the returned from the peninentent plane, they could no long use any of her gifts, effetely stripping them of all auspice. Luna also demands that any Garou that have fallen to the forces of the Wrym and the Weaver to be taken to Erebus if they can be caught alive.<br /> <b><u>The Repentant </u></b><br /> The repentant are a small but growing faction in the Nation. These are Garou who were found guilty of crimes and sentenced to be redeemed or die in the spirit realm of Erebus. Their crimes vary as does the time spent in Erebus to cleanse them of their sins. The wolves who step into Erebus never return the same, the put off a strong sense of quiet stoicism that some of their former pack mates and friends find quite unnerving. Some return with stronger ties to lunes and strange powers that have yet to been seen. As of yet no Black Spiral Dancers have returned from the realm of silver, and no one expects them to.<br /> <b><u>The Garou Nation</u></b><br /> <i>STORY</i><br /> <br /> It is a time of strange cooperation between the tribe and the fera. Hearing the voice of Gaia and hearing that all have failed her and their purpose has been a hard pill to swallow. Many of the repentant have fallen deep to despair and huarrano, while other more prideful garou have fallen to the enemy. The rest of the nation has rekindled alliances and refocused their attention into becoming a strong unified fighting force. This has not been without its share of bumps along the way. Since many of the leaders of the nation never left the last battleground, the garou needed to find its leaders quickly. The majority of the leadership has been shared between the Children of Gaia and the Shadow Lords, The silver Fangs are still in the leadership but in very low numbers. The nation stand united in a loose confederation of septs and packs that will offer aid and supplies to those who need them. The nation however has little sympathy to those who don\u2019t offer aid in return or do not work their fair share and a few septs and packs have been exiled thanks to their unwillingness to aid the nation as a whole.<br /> The litany stands as it ever has but has been revised by the tribal totems.<br /> <b><u>The Tribes</u></b><br /> The tribes failed Gaia. This is not open for debate, it\u2019s a damn fact. Each Werewolf knows this now, and their shame will never be forgotten. Only by winning the Apocalypse war can they win back some shred of honor.<br /> The tribes now work towards strengthen themselves and wreaking their many enemies. All while not warring with each other. It\u2019s a strange time and some still long for more simple times. How each tribe has handled this second chance is more of a miracle than anything else.<br /> <b><u>BLACK FURIES: </u></b><br /> <b><u>BONE GNAWERS: </u></b><br /> <b><u>CHILDREN OF GAIA: </u></b><br /> The children of Gaia now stand in a prominent spiritual leadership position of the Garou Nation and are still trying to live up to that heavy burden. Gaia\u2019s words to the Children have forced them all to take a hard look at what they do and contribute to the Nation as a whole and they refuse to be found wanting.<br /> Most Children have limited the use of drugs, while some have turned to them as a way to escape their failings. These outcasts are rehabilitated has much as they can be but they are usually sent on long suicide mission where their indifferences can be uses for some good.<br /> The children have focused their time between acting as healers and mediators for the nation and its allies. The scars of the past prove to be difficult to heal.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer: WtF Night Horrors: Shunned by the Moon<br /> United States Sailor, First Responder,Ally, Bad Speller, Book Hoarder and all around Nerd.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2640-rx781a","name":"rx781a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2640_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}